    "groundContactBasis": "The connected passenger ensemble uses one standard host field datum outside its street facade. Exact threshold/platform grades remain approximate. Exact current platform polygons,bridgepath andthree stairalignments are retained fromstandard PMTiles. The wholelongcanopy profiles,bluepost/trusses andgrey-sided stationoffice come fromordinary2023/2025 photographs. Absent mapheights areexplicit estimates:closed-office/annex floors1.25m,westernwarehousefloor2.8m,officeeave10.25/ridge12.8m,otherroofs4.7–7.3m,platformfloor3.3m,canopyeave7.6/ridge8.4m,bridgefloor9/handrail10.2m ononecommon2Dfielddatum. Narrowstairheadroomslots areanexplicit constructioninterpretation preservinganopenroutethroughthecanopies,not acopiedfloorplan. Exactcurrenthiddenfacades,roomuses,roofinventory,raillevels andaccessiblethresholds remainunverified. One unchanged global field sample outside the office row at[-50,-70],150.377775m,defines commonY=0. All source levels are fixed relative to this common reference. No per-part runtime offset or terrain flattening. TheNNW streetstair terminates3.5cm abovetheunchangedhostfield sample atitsmappedend[-40.25,-76.49],fixedsourceY=-0.341446m;bothplatformstairsendat3.3m. Thisisnot anindependent runtimehostoffset.",
